{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-6262958","kind":"blog","type":"Game Freak 博客","card":"blog","title":"【活动】2016宝可梦世界大会","display_title":null,"dek":null,"excerpt":"世界大会最终日，签名会、卡牌与视频游戏决赛接连展开，增田为冠军颁发奖杯，并公布下一届举办地。","date":"2016-08-22","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモン世界大会 Day 3","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ポケモン世界大会 Day 3","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/6262958.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160824230252id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/6262958.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"mentions":[],"works":[],"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ポケモン","イベント"],"categories":["官方博客","Game Freak","数字存档"],"topics":[],"primary_work":null,"length":588,"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-6262958/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"pages":0,"proof":null,"cover":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/002-9d443b9bba.webp","cover_kind":"own","size":[1043,703],"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"世界大会最终日，签名会、卡牌与视频游戏决赛接连展开，增田为冠军颁发奖杯，并公布下一届举办地。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">世界大会最后一天</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">从签名会开始！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">抽选出的150人参加森本君和增田的签名会\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/002-9d443b9bba.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/002-9d443b9bba.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1043\" height=\"703\"></a></figure>\n\n\n背后有可达鸭（笑）\n\n签名、合影，还聊了聊天！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后\n<br>\n\n\n这期间，卡牌游戏的\n\n大会也在继续\n\n世界第一名决出！\n\n<br>\n\n\n少年组是\n\n日本的\n\nShunto Sadahiro 选手！ \n\n<br>\n\n\n老年组是\n\n丹麦的\nJesper Eriksen选手！ <br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大师组是\n\n日本的\nShintaro Ito 选手！ <br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n恭喜你们！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n然后是\n视频游戏世界第一名决战！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/003-387d9f399f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/003-387d9f399f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/004-fedc7dfe63.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/004-fedc7dfe63.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/005-6288d8b204.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/005-6288d8b204.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n会场嗨到不行！\n\n<br>\n\n\n欢呼声中\n\n对战不断进行！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n终于\n\n世界之巅的归属决定了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n视频游戏\n\n少年组是\n\n美国的\nCory Connor选手！\n\n<br>\n\n\n老年组是\n\n美国的\nCarson Confer选手！ \n\n<br>\n\n\n大师组是\n\nWolfe Glick选手！ \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n大家\n\n不光是培育宝可梦\n\n战略性和预判也都太厉害了！\n\n真的是非常出色的选手！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n恭喜你们！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/006-b66a696b0a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/006-b66a696b0a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n闭幕式上，增田颁发了奖杯！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/007-0afd882688.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/007-0afd882688.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n卡牌游戏和视频游戏的世界第一、第二名一起！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n明年的举办地点也公布了！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/008-2ba0118fa3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/008-2ba0118fa3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n2017年是在离洛杉矶很近的\n\n阿纳海姆！\n\n欢迎大家来参加哦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n闭幕式结束后\n\n传说中的选手\n\n雷君和阿伦君\n\n来找我们啦！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/009-bfc2fd98c3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/009-bfc2fd98c3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n今年的世界大会\n\n\n有这么多朋友\n\n\n前来参加，\n\n\n最终成为了一场\n\n\n精彩的大会！\n\n\n我心中充满了感激！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n各位选手\n\n\n辛苦了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n谢谢大家！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n（附带内容）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/010-1f2ded29ec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/010-1f2ded29ec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n全部结束后，去参加相关人员晚宴，Let's Go！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n漂亮的晚宴会场里\n\n摆满了好多面包！！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/011-fab1a61af8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/011-fab1a61af8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n脸颊和耳朵也很好吃！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">世界大会最終日</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">サイン会からスタート！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">抽選で150人 森本くんとマスダのサイン会\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/002-9d443b9bba.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/002-9d443b9bba.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1043\" height=\"703\"></a></figure>\n\n\n背にコダックが（笑）\n\nサイン書いて写真撮ったり話を聞いたり！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\n<br>\n\n\nその間もカードゲームの\n\n大会は進み\n\n世界1位が決定！\n\n<br>\n\n\nジュニア カテゴリは\n\n日本の\nサダヒロシュント選手！ \n\n<br>\n\n\nシニア カテゴリは\n\nデンマークの\nJesper Eriksen選手！ <br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nマスター カテゴリは\n\n日本の\nイトウシンタロウ選手！ <br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nおめでとうございます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそして\nビデオゲーム世界1位決定戦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/003-387d9f399f.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/003-387d9f399f.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/004-fedc7dfe63.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/004-fedc7dfe63.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/005-6288d8b204.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/005-6288d8b204.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\n会場は超盛り上がりまくり！\n\n<br>\n\n\n大歓声の中\nバトルが進んでいきます！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nそしてついに\n世界の頂点が決まりました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nビデオゲーム\nジュニア カテゴリは\nアメリカの\nCory Connor選手！\n\n<br>\n\n\nシニア カテゴリは\nアメリカの\nCarson Confer選手！ \n\n<br>\n\n\nマスター カテゴリは\nWolfe Glick選手！ \n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nみなさん\nポケモンの育成はもちろん\n戦略性と先読みが凄い！\n本当に素晴らしい選手ばかり！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nおめでとうございます！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/006-b66a696b0a.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/006-b66a696b0a.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n\nクロージングでマスダはトロフィーを渡しました！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/007-0afd882688.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/007-0afd882688.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\nカードゲームとビデオゲームの世界 1位 2位で！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n来年の場所も発表！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/008-2ba0118fa3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/008-2ba0118fa3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n2017年はLos Angeles から近い\nアナハイムです！\nぜひ参加してみてくださいね！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nクロージング終了後\n伝説のプレイヤーの\nレイくんとアーロンくんが\n来てくれたよ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/009-bfc2fd98c3.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/009-bfc2fd98c3.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n今年の世界大会も\n\nたくさんの方に\n\nお越しいただき\n\n素晴らしい大会になりました！\n\n感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n選手のみなさん\n\nお疲れ様でした！\n\n<br>\n\n\nありがとうございました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nチャオ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n（オマケ）\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/010-1f2ded29ec.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/010-1f2ded29ec.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n全て終了後 関係者ディナーにレッツゴー！\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n素敵なディナー会場に\nたくさんのパンが！！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/011-fab1a61af8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/6262958/011-fab1a61af8.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nほっぺも耳も美味しかった！\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br></div>"}}